WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.534
AI replaced your employees. Now introducing the replacement for AI.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.588
HumanGPT. Powered by Steve.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.538
No hallucinations. Understands sarcasm. Even knows when a meeting should've been an email.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.959
Requires coffee. Occasionally complains about management.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:24.079
HumanGPT. The future of artificial intelligence is Steve.
